{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30017_01_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a6db721359b6e164fe55c35964083c5a7c0fe837e087af688adccf05afb1c7c7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99db33dd087d5f781c01ca1a1f31da8603bd5958f4ea12d9e356d4a3feaa98ab",
      "text": "伙伴常伴身旁",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d62962d8d44f7b026e6d4221c6cec9b6bf8322da4a31131cee7ebbfff4981e39",
      "text": "F-LAGS收到了音乐游戏宣传视频的\n出演委托。\n在正式拍摄之前，三人兼顾了解音乐游戏，\n决定前往游戏厅去体验一番。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_a:cmd-000019:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序幕",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_a:cmd-000019:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99db33dd087d5f781c01ca1a1f31da8603bd5958f4ea12d9e356d4a3feaa98ab",
      "text": "伙伴常伴身旁",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63c2b7367835aee3ad95b34c44967f9acf9532b1d6ed8fbe60179ac4675274e8",
      "text": "那么就让我来做进一步说明吧。\n请确认这份资料。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:660da4a6c7a986d1748aac88ea13b7fdf692d82fd50b37fd75321b7e898fd8da",
      "text": "谢谢您！……新作音乐游戏\n的工作，内容是出演宣传视频吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c832f49c147b8a7b979a431a3ad2743865ef5d6ae8b9c50d4daf8c9e0c3fed0",
      "text": "是的。听说是一款准备在游戏厅等场所推出的\n新作音乐游戏，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f375fc38e5caa1d787d3ff39ab08c5d20d1caf92733f2efbc051700bee8da541",
      "text": "对方希望能把相关的宣传推广，\n交给F-LAGS的各位！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_a:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3cb21086a436c88042f967b12f4dc3b2ae2d540fcac964f29f9e6066cc41e52c",
      "text": "嚯。不光是出演宣传视频，游戏里还会\n收录《With...STORY》啊。真厉害啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_a:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18f6041a72821d24871325e1eaa37995f574d6189e29cb8c82993b51e22a698b",
      "text": "音游区一直都可热闹了呢。想到俺们的\n歌曲会在那里播放，就觉得兴奋得不行啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_a:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e13ceca295d0b8994f80f84566f7f960f067291a80fc192603552b8e16215a14",
      "text": "…说起来，大吾以前经常去\n游戏厅呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_a:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bde1b7bacd25c94476a0d0205f7600642d3dd61e77129a4dfeac46ed2d1aa267",
      "text": "…这次看来在很多方面，都要倚仗大吾了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_a:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98022abff6ca244afa8d36938013745e3a183ef3d17422d4165d25272512421c",
      "text": "只要是俺能帮上忙的，就包在俺身上！\n再说了，大家一起齐心协力的话肯定没问题！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_a:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:719b8a5c1d8c5675542235262b8df2e6095fa722bfa1f25f7428df98bd4a12a8",
      "text": "嗯，就是这样！\n集合我们三人的力量，好好完成宣传的工作吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_a:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21cf3247fe1b3f41099ce15a5308888d73831ec225316eac617f812241f91cf4",
      "text": "各位，请多多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_a:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a89ae0e34eb207b3ac8ad526b611607142894f68eee27e1f8d8e18e2f2b3039c",
      "text": "我已经向对方提出了请求，可以在拍摄前试玩。\n如果还有其他不放心的事，请随时来找我商量！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
